The '''Pineapple''' is a legendary [[Food]] available in the shop for all classes.

The [[Pineapple]] heals and grants {{icon/spikes}} over time, which can be useful in {{icon/spikes}}, heal, or [[Food]] builds.

Starting in patch 1.1, the [[Pineapple]] can be combined with the [[Spiked Shield]] to give the [[Pine Protector]] which is strictly better than the [[Spiked Shield]], blocking more damage, and with an array of synergies with nearby [[Food]]s.
